        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_a_03a",
      "hash64": "BE0452237F1A503F",
      "text": "¡Ya sabía yo! Se te nota la determinación hasta\\nen la mirada.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_a_03b",
      "hash64": "BE0453237F1A51F2",
      "text": "¡Ay, perdona! El entrenamiento es algo muy\\npersonal. No debería haber sido tan directa.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_a_04",
      "hash64": "23D034958FE33771",
      "text": "Sea como sea, ¿por qué no echamos unas\\ncarreritas junt[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oas para conocernos un poco mejor?[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 54,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_a_05",
      "hash64": "23D033958FE335BE",
      "text": "¡Venga, vamos![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_a_system_01",
      "hash64": "5CE62BAF22FB929E",
      "text": "Tras tres vueltas al área recreativa junto a\\nKendra...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_a_06",
      "hash64": "23D032958FE3340B",
      "text": "¡Uf! ¡Qué bien sienta sudar un poco![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_a_07",
      "hash64": "23D031958FE33258",
      "text": "Me has seguido el ritmo muy bien, novatill[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
